This package vendors a static build (linked-libs/<target>/libbox3d.a) of Box3D,
by Erin Catto, licensed under the MIT License. The full license text is in
LICENSE.box3d.mit. See https://github.com/erincatto/box3d.

Box3D itself is not redistributed as source here; it is a git submodule under
vendor/box3d, built by scripts/build-box3d.sh.

The shipped library is a modified build of Box3D. It is built from the vendored sources with the
patches listed in the source repository's patches/series applied. The modification adds the apronSides field to
b3HeightFieldDef, which lets the edge flags of a height field agree with a neighbouring height
field, and it replaces a sphere's edge or vertex contact on such an edge with the contact against
the plane of the triangle.

The C3 binding itself (box3d.c3i, box3d.c3, box3d_check.c3) is MIT-licensed —
see LICENSE.
